Comment:
 The layout (Heron), TableFormer and DocumentFigureClassifier models are the
 Docling project's, exported to ONNX by docling.rs and hosted with its
 releases. The PP-OCRv3 recognizer and its dictionaries are PaddleOCR's,
 Apache-2.0. Each file's origin is pinned by URL in packaging/fetch-models.sh.

